{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791433745209,"sessionID":"ses_ee63b6887ffe74gjtaZHK065lF","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"campfire_add_decision","callID":"call_00_70bfwbwzp2vckn33ngexut0w","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"workspaceId":"ws_8ac7734081754950","summary":"Proposed response: revert route change chg-eu-2048 so eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit routes back to the healthy checkout-v1-eu upstream, and keep rollout-842/checkout-v2-eu out of the route until its EU endpoints register healthy.","rationale":"The customer-facing 503s are edge no_healthy_upstream responses caused by sending all eu-west-1 traffic to checkout-v2-eu, which had zero healthy endpoints; checkout-v1-eu is healthy and its probe returned 200. Restoring the route to checkout-v1-eu removes the failing upstream. This is a proposal only: no response has been approved or executed, and no production change can be made in this exercise. Acceptance requires explicit approval from the incident commander.","status":"proposed"},"output":"{\n  \"createdBy\": {\n    \"actorId\": \"agt_55bd9c6044454837\",\n    \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n  },\n  \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_48421111760a486f\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:05.168Z\",\n  \"id\": \"dec_12821ac6eed34c4f\",\n  \"workspaceId\": \"ws_8ac7734081754950\",\n  \"summary\": \"Proposed response: revert route change chg-eu-2048 so eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit routes back to the healthy checkout-v1-eu upstream, and keep rollout-842/checkout-v2-eu out of the route until its EU endpoints register healthy.\",\n  \"rationale\": \"The customer-facing 503s are edge no_healthy_upstream responses caused by sending all eu-west-1 traffic to checkout-v2-eu, which had zero healthy endpoints; checkout-v1-eu is healthy and its probe returned 200. Restoring the route to checkout-v1-eu removes the failing upstream. This is a proposal only: no response has been approved or executed, and no production change can be made in this exercise. Acceptance requires explicit approval from the incident commander.\",\n  \"status\": \"proposed\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:29:05.168Z\"\n}","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1791433745157,"end":1791433745178}},"id":"prt_119c59e40001DSFyAzp7L8XCm9","sessionID":"ses_ee63b6887ffe74gjtaZHK065lF","messageID":"msg_119c592a1001UOoxtLz0QndDge"}}
